WEBVTT

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.125
Menchi!

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:23.458
Menchi...

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.542
Menchi! Menchi!

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:38.750
Menchi, Menchi, Menchi, Menchi,
Menchi, Menchi, Menchi, Menchi!

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.833
"I, Koshi Rikdo, give my permission

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:49.292
to turn "Excel Saga" into an
animal anime one more time."

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:50.625
But...

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.542
Stop it! Ouch! Peck, peck! No!

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.375
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:21.292
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:25.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:29.167
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:36.875
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:41.708
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:45.708
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:49.667
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.917
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:52.917 --> 00:01:55.167
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:57.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.792
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:58.792 --> 00:02:00.833
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:05.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.792
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:02:08.792 --> 00:02:13.292
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:02:13.292 --> 00:02:21.125
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:29.667
Hail, Ilpala...

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:31.208
...zzo!

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:33.708
Good morning, ladies.
How is your health?

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:35.792
We ain't worthy of such words!

00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:38.333
That you, Lord Ilpalazzo,
would give thought to myself.

00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:40.458
As unworthy as I am,
with your concern alone,

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:43.333
I could even miraculously
survive an incurable disease!

00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:46.583
Let's healthy, Helsinki!

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.292
And how about you, Hyatt?

00:02:48.292 --> 00:02:50.833
I am well, thank you for asking.

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:54.792
Well, that's pretty normal though.

00:02:54.792 --> 00:02:56.375
Please do not mind me.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.125
All right.

00:02:58.125 --> 00:02:59.917
Then I will go on to the main issue.

00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:03.500
Today's mission is more important
than any other past mission.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.292
My goodness!

00:03:05.292 --> 00:03:07.750
Depending on how
successful this mission is,

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:12.375
our ACROSS's journey to conquering
this city may be greatly reduced.

00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:15.333
So that is why you
asked about our health.

00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:16.333
Exactly.

00:03:16.333 --> 00:03:19.625
I would like you to fully
understand its importance

00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:22.792
and undertake this mission
when you are in perfect condition.

00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:24.583
I understand.

00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.000
I shall put my entire body and soul

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.667
into giving this mission my best!

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.958
For the sake of realizing
the ideals of ACROSS

00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.333
and for the sake of Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:39.750
Though my body may crumble
to dust today, I will have no regrets!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:43.292
I am prepared to become a
cornerstone for the coming era.

00:03:43.292 --> 00:03:46.792
Oh, I cannot remember,
even if I try to forget.

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:49.500
Long, long time ago,

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.000
I was touched by Lord
Ilpalazzo's arrogant ideology

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.250
and happiness and sadness
and the months and years...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.250
Now that I think back,
I have come so far...

00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:03.000
No, I will refrain.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.792
We will need you to
work hard today after all.

00:04:06.792 --> 00:04:08.292
It's that important?

00:04:08.292 --> 00:04:11.208
Just what kind of mission is it?

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.333
This mission...

00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:18.750
"Freedom"

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.000
Oh, you hit it too far, Giant!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.500
What?! You trying to cheapen
my home run, you idiot?!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.750
That's right, that's right!
How dare you, Nobeta?!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.917
That's not fair!

00:04:43.917 --> 00:04:46.250
What did you say?!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.458
Help me, Dotaemon!

00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:55.792
The futon went flying!

00:05:07.417 --> 00:05:08.167
"Freedom"

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:09.583
Stop!

00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:11.458
Dotaemon!

00:05:14.292 --> 00:05:16.583
"F City, F Prefecture
Sanitation Department"

00:05:20.583 --> 00:05:22.458
Help me, Dotaemon!

00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:44.417
You've got some nerve!

00:05:44.417 --> 00:05:47.417
I won't go easy on you
just because you're a dog!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.375
Stowing away is a serious crime.

00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:53.125
Well, if you have money,
that's a different story.

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:55.458
But you don't, do you? In that case...

00:05:55.458 --> 00:05:57.750
I guess all we can do
is turn you into dog stew.

00:05:58.625 --> 00:05:59.792
--Damn it, quit struggling!

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:01.292
--Stop that!
--Damn it, quit struggling!

00:06:01.292 --> 00:06:02.542
Who are you?

00:06:02.542 --> 00:06:06.208
I have heard your story,
I have pulled your nose hairs.

00:06:06.208 --> 00:06:07.833
Don't you think it's
terrible to extract a fee

00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:10.125
from such a defenseless doggy?

00:06:10.125 --> 00:06:12.750
Leave us alone!
That's the law of the sea.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:17.417
Or are <i>you </i>going
to pay for this dog?

00:06:17.417 --> 00:06:19.167
Will this do?

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:22.292
Still not enough?

00:06:22.292 --> 00:06:25.250
Not at all! It's plenty!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.667
You're not the...

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:29.792
The one that's really successful
all over the world right now...

00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:34.708
From steel to fried noodles!

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.458
The guardian goddess of your home!

00:06:36.458 --> 00:06:38.500
We anticipate your needs!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.500
The Alps Group is behind you!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.375
Alps! Alps! Alps is at your service!

00:06:47.542 --> 00:06:49.458
N-No mistake about it!

00:06:49.458 --> 00:06:51.458
She's the only
daughter of the Alps Group,

00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:52.792
--Anne Anzai!

00:06:52.792 --> 00:06:54.875
--Now, if you don't want to be reduced to begging,
--Anne Anzai!

00:06:54.875 --> 00:06:56.375
go back to your ship!

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:58.083
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:04.375
My, you've already learned
my name? What a clever doggy.

00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:06.042
I shall reward you.

00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:10.375
You need not thank me.

00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.875
After all, helping those
in need is the duty of the rich!

00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:21.042
I'm in the middle of traveling
around the world right now.

00:07:21.042 --> 00:07:22.375
Why?

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:27.000
Grandfather passed away and
I'm supposed to inherit the Group,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:31.083
but to do that, I need to travel
around the world in eighty hours.

00:07:32.083 --> 00:07:36.292
I'm not allowed to use airplanes.
His will says so.

00:07:36.292 --> 00:07:41.375
Absurd? Maybe, but this is a test
to become the head of the family.

00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:43.417
Besides, since I'm still young,

00:07:43.417 --> 00:07:47.417
Uncle will be helping me as my guardian,
so it will be all right.

00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.333
Hey, what's wrong?

00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:03.333
He got away.

00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:07.042
That was most likely a hitman.

00:08:07.042 --> 00:08:11.958
Some people in the Group are
against my being the successor.

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:19.292
Thank you for helping me.
You saved my life.

00:08:19.292 --> 00:08:21.250
My, you just call it returning a favor?

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.042
I think we would get along well together.

00:08:23.042 --> 00:08:25.625
Won't you come travel with me?

00:08:25.625 --> 00:08:27.917
Really?! How dependable you are!

00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:30.625
I feel as though the god
of luck has become my ally!

00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:33.208
Oh, that would be goddess,
wouldn't it?

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.083
According to this book,

00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:42.792
there should be the ruins of the
lost Nonbendararin around here

00:08:42.792 --> 00:08:44.250
and a god of destruction for

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.792
the end of the century-ish
thing sealed within it.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:49.458
Something that
crazy can't be reliable!

00:08:50.417 --> 00:08:52.167
Hatchan, don't move!

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:54.042
At this rate, it's going to turn
into two women's leisurely trip,

00:08:54.042 --> 00:08:56.958
where the account of the journey
will tell how we died on the road!

00:08:57.375 --> 00:08:58.708
Hey!

00:09:01.375 --> 00:09:03.458
Did I just hit something?

00:09:04.333 --> 00:09:08.208
I thought I saw a girl in
a Japanimation-looking costume.

00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:09.750
I guess it was just me.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.833
Well, if it comes down to it,
I'm rich enough to get out of it.

00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:17.625
Come to think of it, I haven't
even asked your name yet.

00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:19.000
I can't understand.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.083
Oh, I know!

00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:22.542
When I went to the
inner city to study society,

00:09:22.542 --> 00:09:24.375
I had something unusual.

00:09:24.375 --> 00:09:27.833
It was oily and seemed high
in calories, but very delicious.

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:31.792
Somehow, seeing you reminds
me of it, so I'll name you Menchi.

00:09:31.792 --> 00:09:33.792
Was that too explanatory?

00:09:41.708 --> 00:09:43.375
What's wrong?

00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:53.333
Oh, really! What a persistent man!

00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:56.042
Menchi,

00:09:56.042 --> 00:09:57.792
take the wheel!

00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:01.250
Here he comes!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.583
You're doing wonderfully, Menchi!

00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:12.208
Here we go!

00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:27.583
That hurt!

00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:32.500
We did it! Bravo, Menchi!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.917
Oh, this?

00:10:33.917 --> 00:10:37.042
People have been after my
life all the time since I was a child,

00:10:37.042 --> 00:10:39.292
so I've just gotten good at it.

00:10:39.292 --> 00:10:43.125
So far, several people have...
Oh, how vulgar of me!

00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:45.792
Now, let's go.

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:02.000
Coffee from its birthplace
certainly is soulful!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.667
Now, let's go.

00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:11.125
Wha-What does this mean?!
Someone please explain it to me!

00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:12.792
There's nothing to explain.

00:11:12.792 --> 00:11:16.458
The women just drop
like flies for my charm.

00:11:16.458 --> 00:11:18.417
Dear, is it true?!

00:11:18.417 --> 00:11:21.792
I'm sorry,
but it's partly your fault too.

00:11:21.792 --> 00:11:25.625
All you did was work and you
never looked back at your family.

00:11:25.625 --> 00:11:27.625
B-But I did it for you...

00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:28.792
Shut up!

00:11:28.792 --> 00:11:32.042
This man came to see me by
commuting from Japan every day!

00:11:32.042 --> 00:11:34.375
Shock!

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:39.583
You have to be diligent
to score with women.

00:11:39.583 --> 00:11:41.167
Ms. Will...

00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:43.458
Mr. Pe, please forgive me.

00:11:43.458 --> 00:11:47.542
I, too, am a woman before
I am the Will of the Macrocosm.

00:11:47.542 --> 00:11:53.375
But I thought that you
might be the one. I'm not lying.

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:56.667
As if this guy could possibly
be that legendary man!

00:11:56.667 --> 00:11:58.250
What are you talking about?

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.833
It means that you
still have a chance.

00:12:00.833 --> 00:12:03.208
If you awaken to your true powers.

00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:05.458
Wha-What are you doing?!

00:12:08.625 --> 00:12:10.375
Wha-What?!

00:12:18.292 --> 00:12:22.375
Afro, no!

00:12:23.417 --> 00:12:25.208
You hate the afro?

00:12:25.208 --> 00:12:26.625
Yes.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.167
From steel to fried noodles!

00:12:32.167 --> 00:12:34.042
The guardian goddess of your home!

00:12:34.042 --> 00:12:36.042
We anticipate your needs!

00:12:36.042 --> 00:12:40.000
The Alps Group is behind you!

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:44.333
Alps! Alps is at your service!

00:12:44.333 --> 00:12:44.750
"Sponsored by the Alps Group"

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:48.125
"Sponsored by the Alps Group"
Did you enjoy the commercial?

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:14.833
You can't sleep either?

00:13:18.792 --> 00:13:22.500
I was reminiscing
about the past a little.

00:13:23.375 --> 00:13:27.333
My one and only friend,
whom I met on that summer day.

00:13:34.625 --> 00:13:37.458
I was isolated because I was too rich,

00:13:37.458 --> 00:13:40.917
and he was lonely.
We immediately became friends.

00:13:40.917 --> 00:13:43.958
The fact that he was a dog
and I was a human didn't bother me.

00:13:45.292 --> 00:13:50.625
And on the day I had to
return to the city, he came.

00:13:50.625 --> 00:13:56.125
It was thanks to him that I didn't
lose my beautiful and kind heart.

00:13:57.542 --> 00:13:59.917
I still often see him in my dreams.

00:13:59.917 --> 00:14:02.125
I wonder how Wolf is doing?

00:14:10.167 --> 00:14:11.792
One shot!

00:14:11.792 --> 00:14:13.833
Of fighting spirit.

00:14:14.833 --> 00:14:15.875
Don't die, Hatchan!

00:14:15.875 --> 00:14:18.875
Not until we find the
legendary tiger-striped whale!

00:14:21.792 --> 00:14:24.125
Senior, I will be going ahead...

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.083
Come back, Hatchan!

00:14:44.167 --> 00:14:47.167
This is tougher than
I thought it would be.

00:14:48.667 --> 00:14:53.667
But it looks like even that
hitman won't be pursuing us here.

00:14:54.667 --> 00:14:55.792
Don't worry.

00:14:55.792 --> 00:14:58.458
Here, he could appear
ten kilometers away

00:14:58.458 --> 00:15:00.333
and we'd see him right--

00:15:18.958 --> 00:15:21.708
It's no good! Nothing's working!

00:15:22.708 --> 00:15:24.083
Menchi!

00:15:24.083 --> 00:15:27.208
No, Menchi! Run,
and at least save yourself!

00:15:31.208 --> 00:15:34.208
That's reckless!
If you do that, you'll fall in too!

00:15:58.458 --> 00:15:59.833
Menchi!

00:16:00.792 --> 00:16:02.417
You're amazing!

00:16:02.417 --> 00:16:04.667
You really are my savior!

00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:17.000
We've finally come this far.

00:16:18.333 --> 00:16:23.250
Menchi, I am truly grateful.
I owe it all to you.

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:25.625
Say...

00:16:25.625 --> 00:16:26.875
If it's okay with you,

00:16:26.875 --> 00:16:29.792
won't you come live with me
even after we get back to Japan?

00:16:29.792 --> 00:16:34.333
Let's live a life of
luxury and extravagance.

00:16:35.333 --> 00:16:36.792
Who's there?

00:16:36.792 --> 00:16:38.417
You are...

00:16:38.417 --> 00:16:40.625
Oh, what a persistent man!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.083
Uncle!

00:16:46.083 --> 00:16:51.083
Long time no see, Anne.
And to that hateful dog SOB too.

00:16:51.083 --> 00:16:52.958
You know Menchi?

00:16:54.958 --> 00:16:57.583
Yes, I know her well.

00:16:57.583 --> 00:17:01.875
After all, thanks to her,
I ended up dying once.

00:17:01.875 --> 00:17:07.750
But with the newest and best
perfected technology of the Hounds,

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.042
I came back to life.

00:17:10.042 --> 00:17:17.292
Look at this astronomically
expensive body!

00:17:19.333 --> 00:17:23.333
Then you were really after me.

00:17:23.333 --> 00:17:27.833
I need your fortune to
pay for this body.

00:17:27.833 --> 00:17:30.208
I-It can't be.

00:17:30.208 --> 00:17:34.667
In the end, bankbooks are
more trustworthy than blood ties.

00:17:34.667 --> 00:17:39.333
It must be more than chance
that the one who shot me is here too.

00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:40.833
Perhaps fate.

00:17:40.833 --> 00:17:43.042
Right, dog SOB?

00:17:46.042 --> 00:17:47.125
Die!

00:17:47.125 --> 00:17:48.458
Menchi!

00:17:58.167 --> 00:17:59.500
Run...

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:04.167
There is no reason
for you to die here too.

00:18:05.542 --> 00:18:11.083
It was a short journey,
but it was fun being with you.

00:18:12.917 --> 00:18:15.708
It really was fun.

00:18:15.708 --> 00:18:17.708
Just like back then.

00:18:18.833 --> 00:18:20.333
Wolf...

00:18:30.708 --> 00:18:33.375
What an out-of-character way to die.

00:18:42.958 --> 00:18:46.417
Damn you, you're only a woof-woof!

00:18:48.875 --> 00:18:50.375
Take this!

00:18:50.917 --> 00:18:53.375
Stomach Beam!

00:18:57.083 --> 00:18:58.750
Wha-What?!

00:19:07.792 --> 00:19:09.750
Stop it!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:14.625
Let go! Let go, you damn son of a bitch!

00:19:15.625 --> 00:19:17.875
See you again!

00:19:22.958 --> 00:19:25.667
"Hong Kong"

00:19:26.333 --> 00:19:30.250
Okay, we're going to the airport!
Everyone please get aboard!

00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:42.167
But still, that firecracker
just now was awesome!

00:19:42.167 --> 00:19:44.000
I guess that's what
you get in Hong Kong.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:49.458
But the legendary breast
hair grower is certainly elusive.

00:19:49.458 --> 00:19:51.958
Oh, my, Senior. Look.

00:19:51.958 --> 00:19:53.583
This is a murder case!

00:19:53.583 --> 00:19:55.292
But she's still sort of breathing, kind of.

00:19:55.292 --> 00:19:57.042
Hatchan, any way to counter this?

00:19:57.042 --> 00:19:59.875
Well, I have medicine that I don't take

00:19:59.875 --> 00:20:02.250
unless I am really desperate...

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.250
Okay. Go to drug!

00:20:12.042 --> 00:20:17.708
Energy!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.500
Energy, energy, energy, energy!
Energy!

00:20:31.042 --> 00:20:32.625
Menchi...

00:20:46.375 --> 00:20:49.292
"Narita Delivery Service"

00:20:57.292 --> 00:21:00.750
Hey, hey, you saying
you can't come to my recital?!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:03.292
How dare you, Nobeta?!

00:21:03.292 --> 00:21:07.208
But I made a promise
with Shiruka-<i>chan </i>for that day!

00:21:08.875 --> 00:21:11.083
What's up with this dog?

00:21:11.083 --> 00:21:13.375
It's pretty dirty.

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:15.042
You're in the way!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:25.292
I wonder what was wrong with her?

00:21:25.292 --> 00:21:28.292
It was rude of her to run off
without thanking us, you know?

00:21:28.292 --> 00:21:32.250
Well, she regained her health,
so perhaps that is all that matters.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.625
You're right.

00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:37.083
More importantly, what should
we do about failing our mission?

00:21:37.083 --> 00:21:39.250
But we could never have predicted

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:43.250
that mottled sea salamander
would attack us right then.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.083
Menchi, you broke the window!

00:21:46.083 --> 00:21:50.000
My, perhaps she was playing
because she was bored.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.875
And we're in a pinch too!

00:21:53.875 --> 00:21:55.458
You shouldn't do things like this!

00:21:55.458 --> 00:21:57.375
If you're going to play,
don't lounge around the room,

00:21:57.375 --> 00:21:59.750
but go play somewhere outside!

00:22:00.583 --> 00:22:05.292
"Episode 19: Menchi's Great Adventure 2
~Around the World in 80 Hours~"

00:22:05.292 --> 00:22:07.125
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:08.958
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:10.125 --> 00:22:13.292
From steel to fried noodles!

00:22:13.292 --> 00:22:15.125
The guardian goddess of your home!

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:17.208
We anticipate your needs!

00:22:17.208 --> 00:22:20.792
The Alps Group is behind you!

00:22:20.792 --> 00:22:24.708
Alps! Alps is at your service!

00:22:25.875 --> 00:22:27.458
"Maybe we really have..."

00:22:27.458 --> 00:22:29.333
"Maybe we really have..."
"No more scenes..."

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.417
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.417 --> 00:23:06.833
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.833 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:24:00.542 --> 00:24:03.042
Hello, Pedro here.

00:24:03.042 --> 00:24:05.625
The other day, when I was
walking along the shore of the Styx,

00:24:05.625 --> 00:24:08.917
I found a spider lily blooming
admirably among some boulders.

00:24:08.917 --> 00:24:10.458
I realized that even in this other world,

00:24:10.458 --> 00:24:11.917
they are living with all their might,

00:24:11.917 --> 00:24:14.750
and it warmed my heart, just a little bit.

00:24:14.750 --> 00:24:17.833
Next Excel Saga,
out of "The Best of Mr. Pedro",

00:24:17.833 --> 00:24:21.417
"Excel Has A Cold, How Awful",
and "With Winter Coming, Hyatt",

00:24:21.417 --> 00:24:23.083
we will be showing one.

00:24:23.083 --> 00:24:28.594
Please watch again next week!
